{
    "title": "EasEvent: Add events with ease",
    "description": "EasEvent offers an easy way to add events to your calendar in three different ways: snap events using camera, load from an image, or type event description.\r\n\r\nSnap: Instantly create events by taking a photo of an event flyer, a poster, a schedule or a calendar. EasEvent extracts all events details and adds these details to your calendar \u2013 no manual input required, AI will do the job!\r\n\r\nLoad: Have an event flyer or a calendar image already saved on your device? EasEvent enables you to load these images directly into the app and it seamlessly adds these events into your calendar, ensuring you never miss an event.\r\n\r\nType: Prefer the traditional way of inputting details? EasEvent offers a natural language option. Type in event information, including date, time, location, and any additional notes. The app's interface ensures hassle-free data entry, allowing you to swiftly populate your calendar with required details.\r\n\r\nEasEvent automatically imports a list of events from images that represent calendars, schedules or list of events. EasEvent relies on artificial intelligence to recognize events and organize the event details, then finally create calendar events with the relevant details.\r\n\r\nSave your time and experience the ease of adding events to your calendar like never before. Don't let events miss you anymore!\r\n\r\n** Note that EasEvent relies on sophisticated AI techniques and may result in inaccurate event details on some occasions, please check the details of your important events.",
    "descriptionHTML": "EasEvent offers an easy way to add events to your calendar in three different ways: snap events using camera, load from an image, or type event description.<br><br>Snap: Instantly create events by taking a photo of an event flyer, a poster, a schedule or a calendar. EasEvent extracts all events details and adds these details to your calendar \u2013 no manual input required, AI will do the job!<br><br>Load: Have an event flyer or a calendar image already saved on your device? EasEvent enables you to load these images directly into the app and it seamlessly adds these events into your calendar, ensuring you never miss an event.<br><br>Type: Prefer the traditional way of inputting details? EasEvent offers a natural language option. Type in event information, including date, time, location, and any additional notes. The app&#39;s interface ensures hassle-free data entry, allowing you to swiftly populate your calendar with required details.<br><br>EasEvent automatically imports a list of events from images that represent calendars, schedules or list of events. EasEvent relies on artificial intelligence to recognize events and organize the event details, then finally create calendar events with the relevant details.<br><br>Save your time and experience the ease of adding events to your calendar like never before. Don&#39;t let events miss you anymore!<br><br>** Note that EasEvent relies on sophisticated AI techniques and may result in inaccurate event details on some occasions, please check the details of your important events.",
